OL,3,GNEWSACould Skye be a hotspot for rare
OL,4,Afiery orange lobsters?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chances of a European lobster being
OL,7,Forange is one in 10 million - but one
OL,8,Ffisherman believes he's discovered a
OL,9,Fhotspot of them off the coast of
OL,10,FScotland.
OL,12,FLast week Iain Matheson caught two in
OL,13,Fthe space of three days off Skye. He's
OL,14,Fnow seen seven in the same square mile
OL,15,Fof seabed over the last nine years.
OL,17,FLive lobsters are usually a deep blue
OL,18,Fbut the orange colour is caused by a
OL,19,Fgene mutation in the creature's shell.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
